# Whats on Kids Activities July Holidays 2014

Kids! This time round we want a story about the DJEMBE and WHY DO YOU LOVE DRUMMING SO MUCH? Artwork is essential! The winner will be announced at the end of the workshop and of course.....WIN A PRIZE! **Thursday – July 9th- All welcome!** 10.30am-11.30am @ Palmwoods Girl Guide Hut Cnr Lingara and Palmwoods-Montville Rd $10 per child Rhythm Culture presents Drum Sing Dance workshops.  These workshops are for children of all ages, families and lovers of rhythm! There will be jumping, dancing, moving, shaking and of course drumming! Yes, it is that time again!! C’mon kids book your place for the next drum sing dance event in Palmwoods! All ages, family friendly event. Our interactive and engaging Drum Sing Dance workshops are full with instruments, song, and movement. Everyone will play lots of different percussion, including shakers, bells, and other surprises. There will be drums for everyone and traditional songs and chants  to bring the music to life. Learn some African dance moves and make up some of your own to live drumming and a big bass drum to help you get your groove on! You can now [pay online!](/shop-2/product/drum-sing-dance-workshops/) Bookings essential. Spaces are limited.
